WEBVTT

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.420
You're...

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:43.150
I-I'm...

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.300
What am I?

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.960
You're a Dragon.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:16.020
<b><i>Unlimited Fafnir</i></b>

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:30.120
<b>Tear the Dragonkind</b>

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.220
Mitsuki!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.430
N-Nii-san!

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.350
A-Are you all right?

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.230
Get out!

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.940
You've been a bit odd lately, Nii-san.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.190
I have?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.070
You come into my room without knocking.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.650
You approach me when I'm naked.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.990
Your lack of delicacy bothers me.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.990
I was worried you might be hurt.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.000
Besides, who cares? We're siblings.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.130
Well, yeah, but...

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.220
<i>I'm odd, huh?</i>

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.260
Good morning, Mononobe Yuu.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:28.430
This is the first time you've said hi to me.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.060
I-It's not a big deal.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.480
I just happened to pass by.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.560
Liar. You walked toward him yourself.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.820
Now that I happen to be here, 
I want to tell you something.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:43.950
I appreciate your work in 
the fight against Leviathan.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:49.200
I hereby promote you to apprentice classmate.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.580
Just an apprentice?

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.580
Don't go thinking you can become 
part of our family that easily.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.790
You'll have to work for it.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.260
Iris.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.770
What are you doing?

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.430
Class is about to start.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.690
D-Did you see, Mononobe?

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.650
Huh?

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.810
You didn't, did you?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.230
You didn't see anything, right?

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.190
I'm not a pervert.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.360
I'm wearing them, okay?!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.410
Wearing what?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.700
Don't tell me...

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.330
N-No.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.580
I don't always do this.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.670
It's just today, I swear!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.880
Iris, you really...

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:40.800
I'm not clumsy!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.840
Fine! I'll go back to the dorm to put some on!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:56.060
So, we have a change of plans 
for first and second periods.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:57.770
<b>(4) X-ray Exam                                     .

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:57.770
<b>(1) Physical Exam  (2) Vision Exam</b>

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:57.770
<b>Health 
Evaluation</b>

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.560
We'll be conducting health evaluations.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.190
Um, and me?

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:04.490
Of course, we'll have you examined separately.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.660
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.200
The principal?

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:15.370
Come in.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.130
You?

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.220
You have good eyes.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.510
I'm the boss here at Midgar.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.180
Charlotte B. Lord.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.640
This is Micah Stewart.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.140
She's my dedicated assistant.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.600
Glad to meet you.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.650
Mononobe Yuu.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.570
The principal is doing my 
health evaluation personally?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:51.910
I can't have those pure girls getting 
excited at the sight of a male body.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:56.790
Even without that, word of your triumph 
in the fight earlier is already spreading.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.500
Listen!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:04.090
Midgar is a gathering of maidens. 
It's my harem, staff included.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:05.010
Right.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:09.340
Therefore, I have no option 
but to examine you myself.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:12.050
You're a woman, too, aren't you, Principal?

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.720
I'm not the same as those innocent girls.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.850
Besides, I'm not interested in men.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.730
A male's Ryumon.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.440
I've never seen one before.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.280
Principal?

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.780
Silence.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.960
That's the end of the exam.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:38.330
Huh?

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:44.040
The real reason for the health evaluation 
today is to check everyone's Ryumon.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.800
To check the Ryumon?

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:49.510
One of the Dragons we've been 
carrying out our mission to defeat,

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.970
the Red Basilisk, has started 
moving out of the Sahara desert,

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.470
which it holds as its territory.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.680
Is it after one of the students?

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:59.390
That's what the evaluation is to find out.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.310
We'll find out soon.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.520
Anyway...

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:05.730
Hm?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.530
Would you like to go on an adventure now?

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.240
We're right in the middle of 
the health evaluations right now.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:19.580
Those pure girls are in their underwear.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.460
How could we not go to peek?

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.920
You <i>are</i> the principal, aren't you?

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.130
You must be interested in 
women, too, are you not?

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.920
Sure, as much as any other guy.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:32.630
All right, I like you.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:35.300
I've been looking for a comrade this whole time.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.350
Let us be off!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.220
To where we'll find pure girls in underwear!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.100
That's enough, Charlotte-sama.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.480
Let go, Micah.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.730
I must go with my comrade.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.780
Thank you.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:50.240
Micah! You'll regret this!

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.240
Uh-huh.

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.630
I blew it.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.090
As you all know,

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:13.800
the health evaluations show that no one in 
Midgar has had their Ryumon change color.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:19.640
NIFL, having investigated the cities 
in the Basilisk's trajectory,

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.640
has discovered two Ds.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.650
They will receive protection 
here at this academy.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.480
This is Tachikawa Honoka-san.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.780
Please guide her along, everyone.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.570
Thank you for having me.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.610
Next, Tear Lightning-san.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:38.740
She's the one being targeted by the Basilisk.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.160
That little girl?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.540
Does it have anything to do with her horns?

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.080
<i>I've seen her before.</i>

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:52.210
Her Ryumon changing color has 
nothing to do with her horns.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:57.930
Tests have determined that they're 
appendages made from dark matter.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.850
Tear-san is very much one of us.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:02.720
She is human.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.020
I'm not.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.900
I'm not human.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:11.730
That's not true. Tear-san is human.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:12.990
That's not true!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.820
I'm a Dragon!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.530
No. Tear-san...

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:17.740
I'm a Dragon!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.580
I'm a Dragon!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:26.710
Get down!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.300
Are you all right, Mitsuki?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.340
Nii-san.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.180
I found you again!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.070
You're the girl from...

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:06.200
You know, I was born to become a Dragon's wife.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:06.960
Huh?

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:11.170
That makes you my husband!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:11.670
Huh?

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.520
Who would've thought you knew each other?

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:31.270
The mafia took her parents hostage.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.230
She was forced to make jewels.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:37.530
And in a military operation, I...

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.360
Why didn't you take her into protection?

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:44.530
She seemed extremely scared 
when we rescued her.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.790
She was obsessed with seeing her parents.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.960
I made a personal decision.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.000
I understand the situation now.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.340
We'll place her in the Brunhilde Class.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.840
Wait a minute.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.550
Tear-san should be receiving 
primary education at her age.

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.060
I don't think she can keep up with our classes.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:10.230
The other students are already terrified of her.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:14.400
More than anything, she absolutely 
refuses to be apart from him.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:19.150
I'll leave him in charge of teaching her the 
basics and the rules we have at Midgar.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:22.110
But Nii-san hasn't been here very long.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:25.120
It's up to you to support him.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:29.410
Think of it as a part of our 
mission to defeat the Basilisk.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:34.920
NIFL won't stay quiet if she 
causes any big problems here.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.380
The same way they didn't with Iris.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.170
Yuu!

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:43.140
Are you done talking?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.680
Yeah. Starting today, 
you're our classmate, Tear.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.810
We'll be together all the time.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.600
I'm so happy!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.650
Tear-san, be quiet in public places.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.570
Are you being mean to me again?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.320
I'm saying those are the rules.

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:02.400
Don't trouble Nii-san too much, please.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.700
Nii-san?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.120
My name is Mononobe Mitsuki.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.540
I'm his sister.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.790
We'll have to get along, then.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.750
If you're my husband's sister, 
you're my sister, too.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:20.130
This is going to be rough.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.760
It'll be okay, Tear-chan.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:32.230
We'll be with you.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:41.400
Hey, where's your seat, Yuu?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.240
Right there.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.200
Then I'm sitting here, too.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.710
Why? Why?

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.080
Tear-san.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.590
Your seat is over here.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:12:59.460
No.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.170
I want to sit here.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:05.800
Oh, yeah, Tear, you should 
introduce yourself to everyone.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:06.760
No.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.300
I only need my husband.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.860
My husband!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.070
We aren't married.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:28.740
We're not even old enough to be.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.790
It's okay, we're Dragons.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:39.580
Hey!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.880
Am I cute?

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:44.630
Sure.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:51.220
But I'm not a human girl.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.060
I'm a Dragon girl.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:58.350
But you have a human dad and mom, don't you?

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:00.900
No, I don't.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.190
Hey, forget that.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.070
Let's go home now.

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:17.040
No fair, Tear-chan.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.920
I'm Mononobe's friend, too.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.930
I want to help Tear-chan study, too.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.350
Um...

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:39.230
I want to help you, Mitsuki-chan.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.940
We're classmates.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.520
Fine.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.860
Just for today.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.150
Okay, I'll do my best.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.120
Are you sure?

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:55.200
We might not be able to 
handle her by ourselves.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.540
Besides...

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:02.540
We need her to learn quickly 
what it means to be classmates.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.550
I-Is this...

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.930
Mononobe's room?

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.890
This is our new home!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:19.020
Go away. You're not supposed to get in 
the way of newlyweds' first night.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.270
F-First night?

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:21.100
No!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.060
You can't!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:25.020
No fair, Tear-chan!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.190
You're here to study, aren't you?

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:32.030
S-Sorry, Mitsuki-chan.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:33.620
You're a bad sister.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.040
Nii-san, you idiot.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.410
Me?!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.920
Let me know if there's 
anything you don't get, okay?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.130
Done!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:52.760
Already?

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.350
It's all correct.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.020
Yay!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.100
Am I good?

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.140
Yeah.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:02.890
Very good.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.560
Then take a bath with me as a reward.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.730
A bath?!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:08.820
What?!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.070
Can't you take a bath by yourself?

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.820
I'll be waiting here.

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.530
No!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.030
I'm bathing with you!

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.580
I have to be with my husband all the time!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.000
I'm not going anywhere.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.460
No.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.170
You have to be by me.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:30.170
Or you'll disappear.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.050
Well, what can we do?

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.340
You're going to allow it?

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:37.510
Me, too, then.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.060
But on one condition.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:46.400
Don't take your swimsuit off.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.270
Can one of you please get out?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.690
No, I'm not leaving Yuu.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.450
Tear-chan's hogging him.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.160
No fair.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.660
I'm not moving, either.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.290
I'm supervising.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:02.120
It's cramped in here!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.510
Good work, Nii-san.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:19.220
Why is she so adamant that she's a Dragon?

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:25.770
I'm told Tear-san was discovered in 
an armed vehicle of Dragon cultists.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:31.110
She was worshiped there.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:34.610
She'd always been told that she was a Dragon,

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.030
so she believed it.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:41.120
They infiltrate countries hit by Dragons

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.870
to try to earn converts.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:48.210
I'd been instructed to kill the leader on sight.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.720
Let's go to sleep.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:00.640
Yes.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.680
Where should I sleep?

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:05.140
You're on the floor, Nii-san.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:13.400
Be friends with everyone?

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.730
Yeah.

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:16.860
Not just us three.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.910
Why don't you talk to the others, too?

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.530
I don't want to.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.870
There might be bad people.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.500
Was Iris a bad person?

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:30.380
No.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:35.460
Then why don't you at least 
trust your classmates?

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.630
We're all family.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.430
Well, I'm still an apprentice, but...

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.310
My family...

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:01.160
M-Morning.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:04.990
Good morning, Tear-san.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.460
Morning.

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:13.000
Morning. I'm glad you acknowledged me.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.460
Morning.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.340
Here.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.140
It's good.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.100
I want you to read it, too.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.980
Thanks.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.650
I read it, too. It's really cool.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.110
Especially when the protagonist...

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.320
Don't.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.740
Ariela-san, no spoilers, remember?

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:40.530
Yeah.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.780
But I was going to tell her.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.160
I'm not lending you anything anymore, Ariela.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:49.080
Of course.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:49.790
Yeah.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.500
Come on, Fyril!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.670
We've finally taken a step forward.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:57.670
Yeah.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.590
M-Mononobe...

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:06.430
Could I sit on your lap in Tear-chan's place?

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.430
Nope.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:32.750
We can't leave that Mononobe Yuu 
in charge of Tear-san's guidance.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.920
I'll be teaching you myself.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.380
Thanks.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.090
"That" me?

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.760
But yeah, thanks.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:50.890
First, I'll teach you the trick 
to creating imaginary weapons.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:53.230
Imaginary weapons?

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:57.770
In order to do matter conversions 
more precisely and efficiently,

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.480
we conjure weapons with dark matter.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:05.200
Imagine having all your power in your hands.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:09.700
The dark matter will change form naturally.

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.120
Okay, I'll try it.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.630
<i>My power.</i>

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:29.300
<i>All my power.</i>

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:32.720
<i>My... My...</i>

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.060
Tear.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:37.600
You're a Dragon.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:38.560
A Dragon.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:39.860
A Dragon.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:52.950
A Dragon...

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:53.870
<i>I'm...</i>

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:01.790
Tear-san.

00:23:39.890 --> 00:24:09.760
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.770
Oh? A girl who calls herself a Dragon?

00:23:44.240 --> 00:23:45.020
Interesting.

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:46.520
Don't underestimate me.

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:49.500
I'm not picky, so long as you're a pure girl.

00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:51.670
Come closer. Don't be shy.

00:23:51.670 --> 00:23:53.700
What, in swimsuits?

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:55.200
I'm delighted indeed!

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:58.330
The blue seas and white beaches, oh my!

00:23:58.330 --> 00:23:59.870
I can't take it!

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:03.050
Next time on <i>Unlimited Fafnir</i>:

00:24:03.050 --> 00:24:04.700
"Muspelheim of the Flames."

00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:09.020
My comrade, let's enjoy a magical night together!

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:19.930
<b>Illustration: Kagome</b>
